  "ingredients": [
    "4 skin-on, boneless chicken thighs",
    "2 teaspoons extra-virgin olive oil",
    "1 teaspoon smoked paprika",
    "0.75 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat an air fryer to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C) according to manufacturer's instructions.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TjOmHsw2pcph042fW1ZI6AycJ5g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/272858-air-fryer-chicken-thighs056-step1-2453168acd764741b581b6bafb7078a8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272858/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pat chicken thighs dry with a paper towel; brush skins with olive oil. Place chicken thighs, skin-sides down, in a single layer on a plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3Vd35mPigqFmX2jtIwOJMGEJ0jQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/272858-air-fryer-chicken-thighs057-step2-f821ae63373c4c99b430fc23ef013a3a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272858/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine smoked paprika, garlic powder, salt, and black pepper in a bowl; sprinkle ½ evenly over thighs. Flip thighs over; evenly sprinkle with remaining ½ seasoning mixture. Place thighs, skin-sides up, in a single layer in the air fryer basket.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9joHTWQeYdfixgZ4B8lKhPtYtb8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/272858-air-fryer-chicken-thighs059-step4-7c6abeaf585d42d0b1bf1752cdd8d2f8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272858/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook in the preheated air fryer until thighs are brown and the juices run clear, about 18 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into centers should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/M1v_G3GtbFCTVFptNDBPtskgKq0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/272858-air-fryer-chicken-thighs060-step5-9ba2b0a09a2c4344a471aee6185985c2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272858/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hmJM5rfj6jYz268a00xLv-sC0nw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/272858-air-fryer-chicken-thighs-4x3-671aea4bb6aa436bbd29d6e1fbd69f98.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272858/step_05.webp"
    }
